          "startLine": 531,
          "endLine": 555,
          "excerpt": "## Namespaces <a id=\"Namespaces\"></a> Namespaces refer to obtaining certain information from some scope to display in localisation. For example, getting the name of a country, the surname of a character, the ID of a state, and etc.",
          "authority": "Offline Paradox Wiki snapshot",
